  "content": "\n\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/URfh1MsW-R4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>需要 OptiFine</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>本資源包有三個版本</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>普通日月</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>魔法陣</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>動態魔法陣（需要 OptiFine）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>（JVM 需設定 -Xmx6G 且需保留足夠記憶體）</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><strong>推薦光影：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flextermina7.wixsite.com%252fastralex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://lextermina7.wixsite.com/astralex</a></strong></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:24px\"><strong>魔法陣 版本</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/5b41b664798a86c3492011dcf388a868.JPG\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/7d0e605d565e5c9797bc5c76b99c19cc.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/24d9174d63d047d09f17a5901294bc1a.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/e1b4ed2fd6d016afb61b7e2257efce5e.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#00f\"><strong>普通日月 版本</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/85e6320b0b52e1f4fe344db8b594bcf9.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://truth.bahamut.com.tw/s01/202104/86d071871b3405453f3fe83fb6cd2c20.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"371\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><strong>Twitter：<a style=\"color:#00f